@startuml Feature5_Seq_2
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 5: Authentication - Sequence: Refresh Token**

actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nAuthController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nAuthService" as Svc
participant "<<repository>>\nUserAuthTokenRepository" as TokenRepo
participant "<<repository>>\nUserRepository" as UserRepo
participant "<<service>>\nJwtService" as Jwt
participant "<<dbcontext>>\nAppDbContext" as DbContext
participant "Database" as DB

User -> UI: App loads (or access token expires)
activate UI

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/auth/refresh
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: RefreshAsync(refreshToken)
activate Svc

Svc -> TokenRepo: GetByHashAsync(hash(refreshToken), "REFRESH")
activate TokenRepo
TokenRepo -> DbContext: Query Token
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: SELECT
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: Data
deactivate DB
DbContext --> TokenRepo: TokenEntity
deactivate DbContext
TokenRepo --> Svc: return TokenEntity
deactivate TokenRepo

note right of Svc: Validate Expiry\nand UsedAt

Svc -> UserRepo: GetByIdCrossTenantAsync(userId)
activate UserRepo
UserRepo --> Svc: return User
deactivate UserRepo

Svc -> TokenRepo: MarkUsedAsync(tokenId)
activate TokenRepo
TokenRepo --> Svc: ok
deactivate TokenRepo

Svc -> Svc: IssueTokensAsync(user)
Svc -> Jwt: GenerateTokens(...)
activate Jwt
Jwt --> Svc: return (newAccessToken, newRefreshToken)
deactivate Jwt

Svc -> TokenRepo: InsertAsync(newTokenEntity)
activate TokenRepo
TokenRepo --> Svc: ok
deactivate TokenRepo

Svc --> Ctrl: return LoginResult
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return new JSON (Access/Refresh Tokens)
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> User: Resume app usage
deactivate UI
@enduml
